Tells Mantella how aroused NPCs are, so they act on it in their own way.

[center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]TEMPERAMENT[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][table][tr][th]Temperament[/th][th]Aroused[/th][th]At her peak[/th][/tr][tr][td]Reserved[/td][td]Keeps it to herself[/td][td]Hints at most[/td][/tr][tr][td]Bold[/td][td]Lets it show, drops hints[/td][td]Asks you directly, accepts no[/td][/tr][tr][td]Forward[/td][td]Says it openly[/td][td]Begs (never starts a scene without you)[/td][/tr][/table][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]APPETITE[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][table][tr][th]State[/th][th]What happens[/th][/tr][tr][td]Rated[/td][td]Mantella rates her appetite once, from her bio[/td][/tr][tr][td]Counting[/td][td]Climaxes this session are counted against it[/td][/tr][tr][td]Satisfied[/td][td]Arousal drops; she is content[/td][/tr][tr][td]Overwhelmed[/td][td]Far past it; she asks to rest[/td][/tr][/table][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]REQUIREMENTS[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196849]Mantella Living World - Integration Hub[/url][/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/98631]Mantella[/url] 0.14[/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/65454]OSL Aroused[/url][/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]BEFORE YOU START[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list=1]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/98631]Mantella[/url] 0.14: install it and check that a normal conversation works.[/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196214]Mantella - Direct AI Connect[/url]: install it below Mantella in MO2 and run its Setup Backend.cmd once (needs Python 3.11). Without it the stock Mantella.exe runs and Living World does nothing.[/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196849]Mantella Living World - Integration Hub[/url], then the modules you want.[/*][*]API key: your LLM service's key stays in GPT_SECRET_KEY.txt in the Mantella mod folder (in MO2, right-click Mantella, Open in Explorer). A key for another service goes in the file named on the Direct AI Connect page, next to it.[/*][*]Open Mantella's settings page (http://localhost:4999/ui in your browser, only while Mantella is running), go to the Actions tab and turn on Advanced Actions. Many Living World actions (bribe, persuade, marriage steps, positions, map marks and others) only work with it, and it needs a model that supports tool calling.[/*][*]Nothing happens? Living World Main Status in Mantella's settings page lists what is missing.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]INSTALLATION[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list=1]
[*]Install the hub, then this module.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]NOTES[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list]
[*]Climaxes are counted from OStim scenes and from what NPCs report in conversation.[/*][*]Temperament is set per NPC with the hub's hotkey, or left on Auto.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]SOURCE AND LICENSE[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][url=https://github.com/Abhisek571/Mantella-Living-World-Arousal]GitHub[/url], GNU AGPL-3.0 (Mantella is AGPL-3.0). Unofficial, not endorsed by the authors of the mods it works with.

